    <div class="about-card project-card">
      <h2>The Project</h2>
      <p>
        The <strong>Smart Complaint & Service Management System</strong> is a web-based platform designed to 
        modernize complaint handling in universities, hostels, and offices. Instead of manually logging 
        maintenance issues, users can submit complaints digitally and administrators/technicians can 
        track, assign, and resolve them through a transparent workflow.
      </p>
      <p>
        The system covers service categories including electricity, internet, plumbing, HVAC, furniture, 
        and security — ensuring all campus maintenance needs are handled efficiently.
      </p>
    </div>

